"report.privacy.title" = "Error report privacy";
"report.privacy.controller" = "Controller and contact";
"report.privacy.purpose" = "Purpose and legal basis";
"report.privacy.purpose.body" = "We use voluntarily submitted error reports solely to investigate and fix the problem described. Your consent under Article 6(1)(a) GDPR is the legal basis for the description and optional logs. The server records receipt time, this notice version, and your log selection as evidence of your choice.";
"report.privacy.data" = "Data processed";
"report.privacy.data.body" = "We transmit your description, a random report reference, your log selection, and the consent version. The description may contain personal information if you enter it. Please limit it to the problem. Optionally, the previously displayed logs are sent: event ID, timestamp, technical operation, outcome, error category, duration, attempt number, and, where present, HTTP status, error domain, error code, and random request IDs. We do not add location, route, destination, profiles, favorites, or credentials. Sending uses the existing App Attest authentication to verify app integrity. This security credential is not stored in the report. The IP address required for the network connection is not stored in the report or our request logs. Your device stores a random deletion key. It is transmitted over an encrypted connection for submission and deletion; the server stores only its hash.";
"report.privacy.recipients" = "Recipients and hosting";
"report.privacy.recipients.body" = "Only people responsible for fixing errors at nextStop have access. Google Cloud supplies infrastructure as a processor; our server storage location is Frankfurt am Main, Germany. Google and its subprocessors may also process data from third countries for operations and support. Google's data processing terms provide safeguards including EU Standard Contractual Clauses and, where applicable, adequacy decisions. Further details and a copy of the applicable safeguards are available through the contact above. Data is not shared for advertising or tracking.";
"report.privacy.retention" = "Retention";
"report.privacy.retention.body" = "Reports expire 30 days after receipt and are technically deleted within the following hour at the latest. If you withdraw earlier in the app, the description and logs are removed from report storage immediately once deletion is confirmed. A minimal blocking record without description or logs remains until the original expiry so a delayed retry cannot recreate the deleted report. If deletion arrives before the report, this block lasts for 30 days from deletion. Repeated deletion requests do not extend it. Error reports are excluded from backups. Your iPhone stores only the report reference, deletion key, timestamps, and receipt status, not a copy of the submitted text or selected logs. Receipts are excluded from device backups and removed after expiry when the app runs. Separately enabled local logs hold at most 200 events from seven days and can be deleted under ‘Manage local logs’.";
"report.privacy.withdrawal" = "Withdrawing consent";
"report.privacy.integrity" = "Preventing resubmission";
"report.privacy.integrity.body" = "The minimal blocking record after deletion is used solely to enforce your withdrawal and prevent delayed requests from recreating a report. It contains only the report reference, deletion-key hash, and expiry time. Our legitimate interest under Article 6(1)(f) GDPR is the legal basis for this separate security purpose. Under Article 21 GDPR, you can object to this processing on grounds relating to your particular situation using the contact above. Analysis of your deleted description and logs does not continue.";
"report.privacy.withdrawal.body" = "Under ‘Sent reports’, you can withdraw consent for the future and delete your report at any time. An internet connection is required. If deletion fails, the receipt remains so you can try again. Withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of earlier processing. You can also contact us using your report reference. Without a receipt or reference, we may be unable to identify a report; we do not collect additional identity data for this purpose.";
"report.privacy.rights" = "Your data protection rights";
"report.privacy.rights.body" = "Subject to the applicable legal conditions, you have rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, and data portability. Where possible, include your report reference when contacting us. You may complain to a data protection authority, particularly in your place of residence, work, or the alleged infringement.";
"report.privacy.voluntary" = "Voluntary participation";
"report.privacy.voluntary.body" = "You are under no statutory or contractual obligation to send a report or logs. Choosing not to send either does not restrict your use of nextStop. Reports are not used for automated decisions or profiling. Sending does not enable future transfers; each subsequent report requires your own action.";
"report.privacy.google_terms" = "Google Cloud data processing terms";
"report.privacy.authorities" = "Data protection authorities";
"report.privacy.version" = "Last updated: 13 September 2026 · Version 2026-09-13";
